WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.880
Da Nang is waiting for you to explore! And here is a smart companion for every trip: Travel Da Nang.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:12.570
Just type “beautiful beaches” and the AI knows what you mean: the best beaches, and even beachfront hotels, in a single tap.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.640
Prefer a quick search? Type “museum” and the city’s museums appear right in front of you.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:25.270
Standing in front of an unfamiliar landmark? Take a photo and the AI tells you where it is and the story behind it. This is the Dragon Bridge!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:32.370
Need advice? The AI assistant is always ready, from must-try local dishes to places you can’t miss.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.720
Every time you open the app there is something new: popular destinations, places that match your taste, and interesting spots right near you.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:44.920
Everything you need before you go: opening hours, helpful tips, and similar places to explore next.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:49.200
Preview it through photos and videos, to be sure this is where you want to go.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.640
One tap and the route appears, with step-by-step directions. No getting lost!

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:57.830
Want the big picture? Switch to the satellite map and see the traffic too.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.100
And don’t miss the city’s lively rhythm: festivals and events, with dates, venues and costs, all in your hand.

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:08.630
Travelling with international friends? One tap and the whole app switches to English.

00:01:09.896 --> 00:01:14.386
Share your experiences with reviews and photos, and support the project with a single QR code.

00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:18.226
Travel Da Nang. Open the app, and Da Nang is yours!
